          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Flat is the best sheen for nearly every ceiling, because a ceiling is lit by raking light that turns any reflection into visible flaws. Matte is a good compromise where some washability matters, and eggshell or satin belongs only on small, humid ceilings where moisture resistance outweighs appearance.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
